# Sosias, the coin striker in his room by the mule's pen. Three questions: why
# one blow, whether he keeps any coin, and whether he works at night. No errand.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
Sosias: NPC_STRIKER_1
- LOC_STRIKER_CHOICE_1
	Sosias: LOC_STRIKER_WORK_1
	Sosias: LOC_STRIKER_WORK_2
- LOC_STRIKER_CHOICE_2
	Sosias: LOC_STRIKER_PAY_1
	Sosias: LOC_STRIKER_PAY_2
- LOC_STRIKER_CHOICE_3
	Sosias: LOC_STRIKER_NIGHT_1
	Sosias: LOC_STRIKER_NIGHT_2
=> END
